<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. sorghum major sales activity in the week ended Sept 26 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:   1996/97		  1997/98</p>
<p> Chile	  21,000			Nil</p>
<p> Japan	   8,700</p>
<p> Mexico	 -9,500</p>
<p> Venezuela    -3,500</p>
<p>Net sales of 17,200 tonnes were down 71 percent from the prior week.</p>
<p>Exports of 112,400 tonnes were more than twice the previous week and two-thirds above four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Japan and Mexico.</p>
</text>
